          <p>Gain valuable insights with our comprehensive hospital analytics and reporting tools.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- About Section - Redesigned -->
<section class="section about-section bg-light" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">About MediCare Portal</h2>
    
    <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="about-content">
          <h3 class="mb-4">Transforming Healthcare Management</h3>
          <p class="lead">Our Hospital Management Portal is designed to digitalize and simplify hospital workflows, making operations faster, paperless, and more accurate.</p>
          <p>Staff members can register, login, and manage doctors efficiently. Doctors' profiles can be added, edited, or removed with ease. The system also manages appointments, tracks pending/completed visits, and provides an interactive dashboard for better decision-making.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="about-image">
          <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSuv5sRQrRZKy2ngQwNu4EctrSpQC246lTW1Q&s" class="img-fluid" height="100%" width="100%">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="row mt-5">
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="benefit-content">
            <h4>Efficient Workflow</h4>
            <p>Reduce administrative tasks by up to 70% with our automated processes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="benefit-content">
